@startuml seq-03-push-song
' Zangbundel BLE protocol, document v0.10, protocol 1.0 - sections 7.4, 7.5, 9.4, 9.5, 10.3, 10.5
' Scenario 3: the leader pushes a song to the singers ("Nu").
' Render: java -jar plantuml.jar -charset UTF-8 -tsvg -tpng seq-03-push-song.puml

title BLE 3 – Push a song to the singers\nble-protocol.md v0.10, sections 7.4, 9.4, 9.5, 10.3, 10.5

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #0B2545
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #0B2545
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #CFE6FF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #13315C
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #FF8A3D
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFF4EA
skinparam ArrowColor #13315C

actor "Leader (person)" as U
participant "Leader app" as L
participant "Air\n(broadcast)" as AIR
participant "Singer A\n(has the library)" as SA
participant "Singer B\n(no library)" as SB

U -> L : "Nu" on the song's separator bar  [guiDesign D-56]
L -> L : song document {ref{lib, song, hash}, file, lic}\nDEFLATE if it saves ≥ 10 %, frame it, dh/dv  [9.5]
L -> L : state body: seq + 1, ts ↑, cur = ref, title,\ndocs[3] = {dh, enc, len}, pt; sign with sk  [9.4, 10.5]
L -> AIR : beacon updated within 100 ms: seq, flags  [6.4, FR-BLE-03]
L -> AIR : burst: every data set restarts at the changed documents;\nstate first, then 3 complete passes of the song  [7.4]
opt a delegate holds a "stay" connection
  L --> SA : notify State 0004 (if A is such a delegate)
end
L -> U : separator "wordt gezongen", previous one "gezongen",\nleader's own page scrolls to the song  [guiDesign D-56]

par Singer A
  AIR --> SA : beacon with new seq → expect a new state, start repair timer  [10.3]
  AIR --> SA : state frames → verify sig, apply (ts newer)
  SA -> SA : local library has cur.hash → use that file,\nignore song frames  [FR-BLE-12]
  SA -> SA : lyric view scrolls to the song, orange bar 1 s,\nvibrate if enabled  [FR-SING-02, guiDesign D-43]
else Singer B
  AIR --> SB : beacon with new seq → start repair timer
  AIR --> SB : state frames → verify sig, apply
  SB -> SB : no file with cur.hash → show title, "ontvangen…"  [10.3]
  AIR --> SB : song frames (doc 3): 16-byte legacy frames\nor ≤ 984-byte extended frames; bitmap of indices  [7.2, 7.5]
  SB -> SB : group complete → verify dh and SHA-256(file) == cur.hash  [FR-BLE-04]
  SB -> SB : show the lyrics; song added to the session page  [guiDesign D-47]
end

note over AIR : Typical delivery, 2 kB song, no loss:\n1 legacy set 12.5 s · 3 sets 4.2 s · extended 0.3 s  [7.7]\nTarget FR-BLE-03 is met by the burst; losses go to scenario 4.

opt re-push for singers that report a failed transfer  [FR-LEAD-06]
  U -> L : "Nu" again on the song being sung
  L -> AIR : seq + 1 without changing the song: 3 more passes;\nsingers that already have it do nothing  [10.5]
end
@enduml
